      "url": "https://trace.invalid/2wikimultihopqa_023bf04c0bdd11eba7f7acde48001122_long/d6s5",
      "text": "Following the death of her father in 1915, the family returned to Athens.",
      "visible_time_s": 3.952999999994063,
